  "bio": "Joanna Strojna is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Krakow, Poland, specializing in intricate dotwork and fineline tattoos. Her dedication to her craft is evident in every piece she creates at Rock'n'Ink Tattoo, where her attention to detail and steady hand bring clients' visions to life. Joanna's cleanliness and strict hygiene practices ensure a safe and sterile environment, making the tattooing experience both comfortable and professional.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cracow, Lesser Poland Voivodeship, Poland\n\n│ Tatuaże z historią i znaczeniem\n│ Graphic & symbolic · black & grey\n│ Dla osób, które chcą czegoś więcej niż ozdoby\n│ 📩 BOOKING → DM",
